{"unit_id":"kaixinbaba__dsh-complete-notify#card-zh","repo":"kaixinbaba/dsh-complete-notify","commit":"da84f4284dd06bcf2fe7800169d3a89063db462e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"任务完成通知（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在任务结束时给出声音和可见提醒，帮助用户及时发现完成、等待反馈或中断的会话。插件在 DSH 的 shell.overlay 中持续观察会话列表，并在设置页增加通知配置；页面前台显示状态着色的 toast，后台可使用浏览器系统通知。它还展示运行时长、tokens、工具步骤和一句话小结，通知可点击打开对应会话。用户可以切换提醒、音效和系统通知，调整音量，为不同结果选择音效，并测试音效或通知。适合希望在切换标签或处理多个会话时及时获知任务结果的 DSH Web 用户。需保持浏览器页面打开；使用系统通知时需要浏览器站点通知权限。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:699-714","client/client.js:936-950","lib/index.js:110-160","README.md:36-45"]}
{"unit_id":"kaixinbaba__dsh-complete-notify#card-en","repo":"kaixinbaba/dsh-complete-notify","commit":"da84f4284dd06bcf2fe7800169d3a89063db462e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Task Completion Notifications watches DSH Web sessions and alerts users when work ends. It shows status-colored toasts or browser notifications, with sound, run statistics, and a short recap. Settings control alerts, volume, and sounds for different outcomes. Click an alert to reopen its session.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:699-714","client/client.js:936-950","lib/index.js:110-160","README.md:36-45"]}
